Install WooCommerce and complete only the core setup:

- Store location
- Currency
- Products
- Shipping approach
- Taxes
- Payment method
- Order email notifications

WooCommerce’s setup checklist is intended to guide store owners through core launch decisions, including products, payments, taxes, shipping, customization, and launch readiness. 

