Before accepting real payments, confirm:

- The payment provider works for your business location and legal entity.
- It supports your planned customer locations.
- It supports your preferred payout method.
- Its transaction fees are acceptable.
- Refunds and chargebacks can be handled.
- You can meet any identity-verification or business-verification requirements.

Because HopeStand is intended to operate in Togo, verify local business, consumer-protection, tax, payment, and data-handling requirements through appropriate local professional advice before launch.

